        "color": 7,
        "width": 672,
        "height": 448,
        "content": "## Market Data Collection\nThis section starts the daily India VIX monitoring process and retrieves the latest volatility index value from the configured data source. The incoming market data is then validated to ensure the VIX value exists, is numeric, and is not invalid before it enters the regime detection process."
