      "parameters": {
        "color": 7,
        "width": 688,
        "height": 448,
        "content": "## Regime Transition Detection\nThis section determines whether the current volatility environment represents a genuine regime transition. The current VIX regime is compared with the previously stored regime, while the percentage movement is calculated for context. If no regime change occurs, the workflow records that result and stops without generating an alert."
      },
      "typeVersion": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "9a371359-69eb-4be9-9073-e20286b79ab9",
      "name": "Sticky Note4",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "position": [
        1344,
